@@ -444,6 +444,14 @@ Here a list of the builtin loaders Jinja provides:
 
 .. autoclass:: jinja2.FileSystemLoader
 
+    ``fallback_searchpath`` accepts a path or an ordered path sequence.
+    Lookup searches all primary paths before the fallback paths. Leaving
+    it unset, or using an empty sequence, keeps the original behavior.
+    Listings include both groups with duplicate logical names removed.
+    Encoding, ``followlinks``, path checks, and source freshness keep
+    their existing meaning. If a primary template is removed, reloading
+    may select the same name from a fallback directory.
+
 .. autoclass:: jinja2.PackageLoader
 
 .. autoclass:: jinja2.DictLoader
